  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '43988f76-25f4-4f54-8b9d-9d19943e12cc', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Analyze the symbolic and practical functions of lanterns in the 'Celebration of Lights', explaining how their upward float contributes to both aesthetic beauty and social cohesion.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-411Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '43988f76-25f4-4f54-8b9d-9d19943e12cc', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Reflect on the broader societal message conveyed by the text regarding the importance of cultural festivals in defining and enriching human experience.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-411Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '43988f76-25f4-4f54-8b9d-9d19943e12cc', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$How does the text suggest that understanding and unity are fostered through the display of various cultural traditions, particularly through the medium of light?$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-411Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '43988f76-25f4-4f54-8b9d-9d19943e12cc', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Discuss the concept of 'shared dreams' within the 'Celebration of Lights'. What might these shared dreams entail, and how does the festival facilitate their realization?$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-411Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '43988f76-25f4-4f54-8b9d-9d19943e12cc', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Analyze the role of 'laughter' as a unifying force during the 'Celebration of Lights'. How does the festival cultivate an atmosphere where laughter brings people together?$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-411Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true);
INSERT INTO public.question_bank (id, institution_id, subject_id, topic_id, grade_level_id, class_group_id, question_text, question_type, options, correct_answer, marks, difficulty_level, tags, source, created_by, is_approved, parent_question_id, sub_question_count, sequence_order) VALUES
  ('94ceb3f8-c576-4ab9-9f29-3b65e1b9d956', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '43988f76-25f4-4f54-8b9d-9d19943e12cc', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Nestled between rolling hills and dense forests lies a small but fascinating town. The Celebration of Lights has been a beloved tradition for many generations in this town. Originally just a small event to celebrate the end of harvest, it transformed into a grand festival of lights when a spectacular comet, called ‘The Lantern,’ lit up the sky one night. This comet became a symbol of hope and unity for the town and the festival began to be held every ten years to celebrate its return. As the town grew more diverse, the festival started to include different traditions of light from around the world, making it a vibrant display of global cultures.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-411Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 24, NULL),
  ('b56069ad-d6b1-4b07-a2da-7bd360d718eb', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '43988f76-25f4-4f54-8b9d-9d19943e12cc', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$fs Learning Outcomes Saaiaaaaaaas ; | After the lesson, I will be able to: Lanterns Of Unit | © read the text with correct pronunciation, : y ' intonation and expressions ' | * learn new words and use them in sentences | H explore and appreciate the theme H ‘answer questions based on the story . apply question tags correctly in sentences ; * write a story Pre-Reading Name the festivals celebrated in different parts of the world based on the description provided. Description Of The Festival Clue Image Write The Country Name The Of Origin Festival This festival is celebrated with colourful powders and water. This holy month involves fasting from dawn to sunset. This festival involves a feast to thank the harvest. Nestled between rolling hills and dense forests lies a small but fascinating town. The Celebration of Lights has been a beloved tradition for many generations in this town. Originally just a small eventto celebrate the end of harvest, ittransformed into a grand festival of lights when a spectacular © comet, called ‘The Lantern,’ lit up the sky one — night. This comet became a symbol of hope and unity for the town and the festival began to be held every ten years to celebrate its return. As the town grew more diverse, the festival started to include different traditions of light from ~ around the world, making it a vibrant display of Sar” global cultures. a Zo English-8 (45)$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-411Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 24, NULL),
  ('77ae551e-b2ee-4f1a-ace6-b8dbd50ca5b0', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '43988f76-25f4-4f54-8b9d-9d19943e12cc', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Excitement builds as the festive year begins. This year, the organiser has added something new — the Heritage Capsule. It lets everyone leave messages for future generations. At a town meeting, the Committee Chair jokes, “Let’s link our past to our future with these messages—and please, no mention of anyone’s secret!”$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-411Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('8f19af9c-f641-457d-ae0e-7814dbab99b3', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '43988f76-25f4-4f54-8b9d-9d19943e12cc', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The festival starts at dusk with chimes from the old clock tower. The Great Square is lit with many oil lamps, buzzing with energy.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-411Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 2, NULL),
  ('b5e13b7a-c4d1-47bd-8ecf-42f3ae922f23', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '43988f76-25f4-4f54-8b9d-9d19943e12cc', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Young Anika, amazed by the lights, asks her teacher, “Can these lights send our stories to the stars?” Her teacher laughs and says, “Maybe they can! Perhaps the stars will spread our stories across the sky.”$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-411Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('86e2bd28-4e65-4315-b018-8d0ee487a25d', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '43988f76-25f4-4f54-8b9d-9d19943e12cc', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$As the light from Diwali continues to glow, it blends into the star-themed decorations for Japan’s Tanabata.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-411Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 2, NULL),
  ('1e132bb0-918e-47fe-b557-12c21d738081', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '43988f76-25f4-4f54-8b9d-9d19943e12cc', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The Mayor connects the two celebrations by saying, “It looks like whether we're lighting lamps or hanging wishes, we all love reaching out to the stars. It’s like a game where we all connect through the sky.”$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-411Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 2, NULL),
  ('3fb52526-79a1-4eee-9ae2-efddb8d8b55c', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '43988f76-25f4-4f54-8b9d-9d19943e12cc', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Just as the Tanabata wishes to flutter in the wind, it starts to rain. But the festival spirit doesn’t falter. It shifts to the Brazilian Carnival vibe.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-411Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 2, NULL),
  ('516fcd47-add3-4608-8e00-50ec32ba59a2', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '43988f76-25f4-4f54-8b9d-9d19943e12cc', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The organiser, smiling widely, says, “In Brazil, we call this liquid sunshine! Let’s dance to make our spirits grow!” Everyone puts on colourful ponchos and dances even harder, turning the square into a lively, splashing dance floor.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-411Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 2, NULL),
  ('9ec95086-bc35-498c-8f60-5c739761fb42', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '43988f76-25f4-4f54-8b9d-9d19943e12cc', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Soon the rain stops and a beautiful rainbow arches across the sky. The Mayor opens the Heritage Capsule and reads a note that makes everyone laugh, “To those who open this— remember canned goods expire, but good memories don’t. Cherish every moment and every joke!”$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-411Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 2, NULL),
  ('c170e51b-aa72-429b-a464-f9275560075b', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '43988f76-25f4-4f54-8b9d-9d19943e12cc', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Inspired, Anika adds her message, “Let’s hope our future is as bright as this festival—even brighter than my last batch of holiday cookies!”$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-411Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 2, NULL),
  ('6f17ef36-c8c0-423e-8bef-5ef4df5b26d5', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '43988f76-25f4-4f54-8b9d-9d19943e12cc', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$As the lanterns are released into the evening sky, they create a magical sight. A scientist comments, “These lanterns are like messages to the universe.”$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-411Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 2, NULL),
  ('33ff573e-eafc-44f1-a497-e6e2df954cf0', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '43988f76-25f4-4f54-8b9d-9d19943e12cc', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$A child giggles and asks, “Do space birds retweet our messages?” The scientist laughs and replies, “Only if they’re bright enough to catch a star’s eye!”$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-411Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 2, NULL),
  ('a0bd754e-44e8-4d07-aada-a8de771bddff', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '43988f76-25f4-4f54-8b9d-9d19943e12cc', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$As the lanterns float upward, creating a laughter to bring people together, showing beautiful light display, everyone feels a strong that despite our differences, we all share the connection. desire to celebrate life. The Celebration of Lightsis more than justa festival; it’s a moment Tanabata to Brazilian Carnival uses light and __ of unity, laughter and shared dreams.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-411Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('5c238730-1574-4626-aa5d-5bfd1cae74d3', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '43988f76-25f4-4f54-8b9d-9d19943e12cc', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The greatness of a culture can be found in its festivals. TIMEFOR DISCUSSION Festivals are a great medium to promote unity in diversity.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-411Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('293206ba-09a7-40f3-aee0-201e0f31adc1', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '43988f76-25f4-4f54-8b9d-9d19943e12cc', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$What is the purpose of the Heritage Capsule in the festival? (b) to preserve historical traditions and stories$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-411Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('2775f34a-5c05-4941-91f7-5d2a02979f15', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '43988f76-25f4-4f54-8b9d-9d19943e12cc', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Assertion: The ‘Celebration of Lights’ promotes cultural diversity and unity by showing different ways cultures use light. Reasoning: Using lights to display various cultural traditions fosters understanding and unity.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-411Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
